### Start analysis
# @name analyze
POST {{base_url}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repo_url": "https://github.com/jsynowiec/node-typescript-boilerplate",
  "concern": "Are there vulnerable dependencies in this project? If so, which ones and how severe are they?"
}


### Get analysis status
GET {{base_url}}/analyze/{{analyze.trace_id}}


### Resume analysis (chat — awaiting_approval state)
# Only valid when the job status is "awaiting_approval"
POST {{base_url}}/analyze/{{analyze.trace_id}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Yes, please proceed with the full analysis including transitive dependencies."
}

###

### Reject / redirect analysis (chat — awaiting_approval state)
POST {{base_url}}/analyze/{{analyze.trace_id}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Cancel the analysis."
}
